{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The nakedness of the land.</b> Because the custom is to hide the ervah, since it is a shameful thing, therefore he spoke by way of proverb. Or because the ervah is hidden, so too you have come to see the secret of the land. And this is the correct one in my eyes."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:49.046449156Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}